# The repository is developed from both Windows Git and WSL Git against the
# same working tree. Without a fixed line ending the two disagree on every
# text file: the provenance guards then report a dirty source tree, and
# staging that "fix" would commit CRLF blobs. Normalize to LF in the index
# and in the working tree on every platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Retained evidence and assets must never be line-ending converted.
*.png binary
*.pt binary
*.npz binary
